data: {"id": "1ba49130f36f4a6d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1575", "run_id": "1ba49130f36f4a6d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将执行证据采集计划，调查 `aiops-case-v01/workload` 的 PendingUnschedulable 根因。\n\n1.  **ep1**: `kubectl describe pod workload -n aiops-case-v01` - 获取状态和事件。\n2.  **ep2**: `kubectl get pod workload -n aiops-case-v01 -o yaml` - 获取资源请求和调度约束。\n3.  **ep3**: `kubectl get nodes -o wide` - 检查集群节点状态。\n4.  **ep4**: `kubectl events` for pod - 获取详细的 FailedScheduling 事件。\n5.  **Metrics**: 已执行，结果为 `Pending` 且 UID `60cbeb41...` 一致。\n6.  **Logging**: 已执行，结果为空（预期，因为 Pod Pending 未启动）。\n7.  **Tracing**: 已执行，结果为空（预期，Pod IP 为空）。\n8.  ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788859306068, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

